      "content": "helpin others? how? they're all gonna drown too. it's all just a cycle of fear and fighting for a few more minutes of breath before the water takes us. i just keep thinking... if we know how it's going to end, why do we have to go through the terror of it? wouldn't it be more dignified to just face it on our own terms, instead of being dragged down by the panic and the cold?",
